              }
            ],
            "id": "p-dfc3ab3590c469d6"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [],
            "id": "p-882a20e6379eb83a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Ryuudou Temple, Fuyuki City"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-671d4ad2c2a3d937"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [],
            "id": "p-882a20e6379eb83a-2"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Team Saber"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Master: Shirou Emiya"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "An ordinary high schooler with a straightforward personality. A good-natured guy with a strong sense of justice."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-516734ea99562fa1"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A Saber-class Servant. A knight who champions the weak and stands against the mighty, earnest and resolute in all things."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-069ce7862552f9ae"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Team Archer"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Master: Rin Tohsaka"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "One of the administrators of Fuyuki City, and the current head of the Tohsaka family. That would be me."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-377e5e09eeb59691"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "An Archer-class Servant. A Servant whose true identity remains a mystery. Cool-headed and pragmatic by nature."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sports gray hair. Though classified as an Archer, he is also an expert in a wide array of other weapons."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-83c71425fa66e516"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Team Berserker"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Master: Illyasviel von Einzbern"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A petite girl with beautiful long silver-white hair."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Don't let the looks fool you. She's got a surprisingly sharp tongue and a bit of a little devil in her."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-27742f944c44eeea"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A Berserker-class Servant. A legendary hero of myth. Blessed with immense life force and an iron will, he stands as one of the most powerful Servants in this Holy Grail War."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-17bc3bf0300a1788"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Team Caster"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Master: Soichiro Kuzuki"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A teacher of few words with an air of quiet austerity."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-625933229703992b"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A Caster-class Servant, she's the wickedly brilliant grand witch of legend, passionate in both love and hate. She is clad in a purple robe that fans out like a bat's wings."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3c77adabdea67b32"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Team Assassin"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-78b435e7b9121e58"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Servant: Kojirou Sasaki"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A swordmaster Assassin-class Servant. His Master is not one of the seven Masters of this Holy Grail War."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It can be said that his very existence is a highly anomalous case among the many Holy Grail War rituals."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-c00cab831707b59c"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Team Rider"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Master: Shinji Matou"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The eldest son of the Matou family, one of the three great mage families based in Fuyuki."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Has plenty of talent, except when it comes to magecraft."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3c0dc9ade7f4fdf8"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A Rider-class Servant. Once worshiped as a goddess in myth, now depicted as a monster incapable of making contact with others."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-e06144886e0d0e2f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [],
            "id": "p-882a20e6379eb83a-3"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Team Lancer & Overseer"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Master: Kirei Kotomine"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A member of the clergy with a saintly aura. From his position as an Overseer, he should theoretically avoid intervening in the conflict, but..."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-39a1be44ff31bcf6"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Two Servants are present simultaneously: Lancer and Archer."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Why there are two Archers, you ask? Well, that is another story entirely."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But if it concerns the oldest King of Heroes, the one who holds all the treasures and wisdom in the world, nothing he does should come as a surprise."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-fd8f9f50121c1abb"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "..."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-dfc3ab3590c469d6-2"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2",
      "volumeKey": "ii-root-and-origin",
      "label": "(II): Root and Origin",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "..."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-dfc3ab3590c469d6"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [],
            "id": "p-882a20e6379eb83a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Like a book, it records the causes, processes, and ends of the infinite things in the universe."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "An empty cosmos, and magecraft included, owes its very existence to this item, hence the name \"Root.\""
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-7ebdd3f7ccc9a62e"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It's not hard to see that it is both \"infinite knowledge\" and \"the start of an empty cosmos,\" a walking contradiction."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And so, the so-called \"Root\" is really just a concept humans invented to wrap their heads around the idea of infinity."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "After all, if infinity is going to mean anything, you need a boundary to define it. Otherwise, the very distinction between finite and infinite loses all meaning."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-11e5d13d0409af9a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "If Root is the primordial \"cause\" of the cosmos itself, then Origin is the individual \"cause\" behind every single thing that exists within the cosmos."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It's like an arrow, fixing the direction of development the moment something comes into being."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-eecd59c918ddfdad"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "No living being can defy this directionality. As the saying goes, \"You reap what you sow.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Yet living beings are rarely aware of where their Origin lies. Once awakened, one's consciousness becomes dominated by the Origin, until it becomes the Origin itself."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-eb7c8bdba731e86b"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "..."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-dfc3ab3590c469d6-2"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
